<title>USA: Costa Rica seeks 30,000 T rough rice - trade.</title>
<headline>Costa Rica seeks 30,000 T rough rice - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica will seek on March 19 a total of 30,000 tonnes optional origin rough rice which would likely be from the United States and/or Argentina, U.S. exporters and trade sources said.</p>
<p>One U.S. exporter said he believed the paddy rice was slated for June arrival while another said it was set for May.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
